	(descr "Hamamatsu MPPC S14160-3050HS, 3.0x3.0mm 50um-pixel SiPM, surface-mount. 5 terminals: center = anode (datasheet B2), 4 corners = cathode common (A1,A3,C1,C3). phi0.7mm pads on a 2.2mm grid, body 3.4x3.4mm. Geometry + 3D model from the ComponentSearchEngine/SamacSys vendor part; pads renumbered 1=anode(center) / 2=cathode(corners) so it mates the 2-pin SiPM diode symbol SIPMLibrary:S14160-3mm (pin1=anode, pin2=cathode), following the S13360 board convention. NOTE: HS polarity is OPPOSITE the S13360 (S14160 anode = center).")
